  "BA": {
   "code": "BA",
   "name": "Bankatlal",
   "identity_paragraph": "Bankatlal Agarwal: an adult man of about 35, medium height, slightly full build, kind attentive face, small neat moustache, warm brown skin. He wears a cream-white turban wound in a round pagadi, a long sage-green cotton angarkha coat to below the knee, tied at the side, over a white dhoti, and a cream shoulder cloth (uparna) over his left shoulder. Barefoot. Nothing in his hands unless stated.",
