   "identity_paragraph": "Devidas: a Brahmin householder of about 45, medium build, gentle devout face, clean-shaven, shaved head with a small tuft (shikha) at the crown, greying at the temples, a small red tilak on the forehead, a white sacred thread across the chest. Bare-chested, a white dhoti, and an off-white uparna across one shoulder. Barefoot.",
